<h1>Your sending domain is verified</h1>

<p><strong><%= @account.name %></strong>'s newsletter and drip emails now send
   from <code>noreply@<%= @sending_domain.domain %></code> — your own domain,
   with DKIM and SPF aligned.</p>

<p>Keep the DKIM CNAME records and the <code><%= @sending_domain.mail_from_domain %></code>
   MX and TXT records in your DNS — removing them stops your mail verifying.</p>

<p>— Kindred Quill</p>
